READING: the crossover k* where min-M(nonAP) first reaches 2/(2k+1) (rise>=window)
is the gap-empty onset.  Below k*: a generalized AP fits the window (gap nonempty).
At/above k*: min-rise >= window, gap empty.  mac-mini HYP-4502 must prove k=12 > k*.
The exact min-rise as a function of k is the metric-alignment quantity their proof needs.
